#. Settings > Play time: every side's play time added up
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2057
msgid "Most played"
msgstr "Los más jugados"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2077
msgid ""
"Your own theme: put a file such as sunset.json in {0}/themes. It appears under Theme by its name:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: a theme to start from (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 to ink-2 (the background), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds and nx (each system's), glass, line, good, warn, bad and focus, as #rrggbb. corners: 0 square to 1.5 round. motif: side, none or eden."
msgstr ""
"Tu propio tema: un archivo como sunset.json en {0}/themes, que se lee al iniciar la aplicación y aparece en Tema con su nombre:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: un tema del que partir (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: de ink-0 a ink-2 (el fondo), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds y nx (los de cada lado), glass, line, good, warn, bad y focus, como #rrggbb. corners: de 0 (rectas) a 1.5 (redondas). motif: side, none o eden."

#. {0} is Eden's data folder; {1} its game files folder (the same one unless another was chosen)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2081
msgid "Saves: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Updates and DLC: beside a game, in its own folder, or in {1}/updates. Mods and cheats: {1}/mods. Covers and names: {0}/covers."
msgstr "Partidas guardadas: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Actualizaciones y DLC: junto a un juego, en su propia carpeta, o en {1}/updates. Mods y trucos: {1}/mods. Carátulas y nombres: {0}/covers, cuando Eden ha leído un juego."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
